Suggests: wireplumber, brightnessctl, foot, greetd
Description: minimal Wayland compositor with a full companion suite
 KumDE is a wlroots-based Wayland compositor with a companion suite of
 binaries: kumbar (status bar), kumlauncher (application launcher),
 kumwall (wallpaper), kumlock (session lock), kumclip (clipboard
 manager), kumidle (idle/DPMS handling), kumnotify (notification
 daemon), kumshot (screenshot tool), and kumde-msg (IPC client).
 .
 Supports tiling and floating window layouts, multi-monitor output
 configuration, XWayland for running X11 applications, and session
 locking via ext-session-lock-v1.
